book python_parameters v1
description "Two parameters the Python client writes as one, class_: it writes class, a keyword of Python, with _ after it"

unit pcs

account stock(sku: string) : pcs
  at least 0 refused as out_of_stock
account suppliers : pcs outside
account customers : pcs outside

transfer receive(delivery: string, class: string, class_: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key delivery, class, class_
  move qty from suppliers to stock(sku)

transfer ship(order: string, sku: string, qty: pcs)
  key order, sku
  move qty from stock(sku) to customers
